# ps(1)

## NAME

ps - list processes

## SYNOPSIS

    ps [-e|-A]

## DESCRIPTION

Lists the processes of this computer with the columns `PID PPID STAT CMD`. STAT is `I` (starting), `R` (running), `S` (waiting) or `Z` (finished, not yet collected).

## OPTIONS

- `-e, -A`: also show finished processes that have no parent

